# Interactive Sudoku Solver

A user-friendly Sudoku game in Python with a graphical user interface, day/night theme toggle 🌙/☀️, region coloring, candidate hints, solution checking, and one-click solve/reset.

---

## Features

- **Easy-to-use GUI:** Click any cell and enter numbers.
- **Colorful Regions:** 3x3 subgrids are color-highlighted for clarity.
- **Light/Dark Mode:** Instantly switch using the sun/moon button.
- **Hints:** Select a cell and click 💡 to see candidate numbers.
- **Check Solution:** "Check Solution" button verifies your board.
- **Auto Solver:** "Solve Puzzle" completes the Sudoku automatically.
- **Reset:** Start over at any time with the "Reset" button.

